+       * packet is a legal empty draw.  On GFX1013 this is the source-supported
+       * ordering mechanism for a shader-written replay command: the tested
+       * COND_EXEC form did not execute the same record, while zero-count
+       * DRAW_INDIRECT did.  Direct-safe pipelines never reach this opt-in
+       * hybrid path, and fitting dynamic workgroups execute no replay shader.
